
---

## 5. Additional Files (Optional)

- Create a `LICENSE` file (MIT or Apache 2.0) if you want.
- Update `app/build.gradle` to specify your application ID, version, etc.

---

## 6. Verify on GitHub

After pushing, go to your GitHub repository page. You should see all files, the README rendered, and the commit history.

---

## 7. Troubleshooting

**If you get "failed to push some refs"**, ensure your local branch matches the remote branch name. Use:

```bash
git pull --rebase origin main
